  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Norwegian Programme for Capacity Building in Higher Education and Research for Development within the Fields of Energy and Petroleum ( EnPe 2013-2018) is a continuation of GLO-3999 Norad&apos;s Masterprogram for Energy and Petroleum ( EnPe 2009-2013). This new phase of EnPe will be closely linked to the new NORHED Programme and the intention is that it will be included in the NORHED Programme as an additional sub-programme during the coming five year period. Hence, EnPe 2013-2018 is intended to s</narrative>
  </description>
